{"id":"wb-6-377","name":"石掌玉皇庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"石掌玉皇庙","text":"石掌玉皇庙位于中国山西省陵川县潞城镇石掌村，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n石掌玉皇庙始建年代不详，现存山门、正殿、东西配殿、耳房、配房等建筑，其中正殿为金代遗构，余为明清建筑。正殿面阔三间，进深六椽，单檐歇山顶，前檐设廊，殿内梁架结构为四椽栿对前乳栿用三柱。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9F%B3%E6%8E%8C%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":93669883,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93669883","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9252a4d2e9120e530a31742f.jpg","title":"20260725_Shizhang_Yuhuang_Temple_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260725_Shizhang_Yuhuang_Temple_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/58/20260725_Shizhang_Yuhuang_Temple_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​晋城陵川 石掌玉皇庙","width":320,"height":213}}